   "en": "⟦0⟧ is a European fascist minor that is a puppet of Germany. When the decision, \"The Reichskommissariats\" is available for Germany from a series of focuses. The AI, or the player in this case, picks this decision when it has conquered the entirety of Czechoslovakia. If Czechoslovakia nation joins the Axis as a member, the decision that makes the country is unavailable for Germany. In the 1939 scenario, ⟦1⟧ starts as a playable Reichskommissariat nation. It borders the ⟦2⟧ to the north, west and south, ⟦3⟧ to the north east and ⟦4⟧ to the east.",
